SUMMARY:Morning Flight Experience
DESCRIPTION:Join CMBO interpretive naturalists to experience and learn about the songbird morning flight that takes place during fall migration. Meets for two hours after sunrise at the observation tower on the jetty road at Higbee Beach. NO preregistration required.  \nIMPORTANT INFORMATION:  \n\nStart time for this event varies based on sunrise\nWeather Permitting \n\nCOST: FREE \nInterested in becoming a member? Please click on the following link to learn more or join: Become a Member today! \n 
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/morning-flight-experience-9/2026-09-05/
LOCATION:Higbee Beach Morning Flight Observation Deck\, NJ\, United States
CATEGORIES:Birding,Cape May Bird Observatory,Cape May Bird Observatory's Northwood Center
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/Morning-Flight_Eventbright_2160x1080.jpg
GEO:38.963900105557;-74.961237642823
END:VEVENT
